                    Rostow, Vol. 70, 4/1-5/68. Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d132-f2" n="2" xml:id="d132-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d131-f2">footnote 2, Document 131</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d132-f3" n="3" xml:id="d132-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed. The key passage in the formula passed by Jarring to Eban on March
                    10, which is bracketed for emphasis in Tab A, indicates that in order to achieve
                    a settlement the contending parties “intend to devise arrangements under my
                    auspices for the implementation of the provisions of the resolution.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d132-f4" n="4" xml:id="d132-f4-content">
                <p>The President checked this option.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
